9476353668fc2351bd2797ec80843bb45b162223988a7bedac4274cbc3","logical_entry_identity":"d395e3eba334b146f8ee810ba595de02f5830fa4a105ef7f32096eccee5b30f5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Blacker than the deepest night, this cold cruel form of darkness approaches.  Long ago it laid aside its mortality, but it has not forgotten its power; rather, its malice and hate have bent this undead entity on the destruction of all things living.","source_tag":"_t","target":"从比漆黑的夜还要深邃的黑暗中，你感受到了一股冰冷的寒意。很久以前它放弃了生命，但却没忘记力量，相反，它被怨恨和邪念所强化，这只扭曲的不死生物要毁灭所有的生者。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"604088b8f03cac7c3c6515bb3d33291ca8410ac0371707b328de44d8d27d4bee","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e7fd832a236d971c7f2e3afb6c092f63d054fcb631fc4db9ee740903e2fc829","logical_entry_identity":"5fd1a4c766456b321882e99f5b25ea75683c64795014f029d1000ac61af55317","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You are very crafty. You can now also embed gems into helms and belts.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你心灵手巧，打造技艺已趋于炉火纯青，可以给头盔和腰带镶嵌宝石。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2d1f0249a230d11fc47bbb015f8baf1f36f8e56d3bec2d5126df82a5cf7877b3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e81e7d513e25125adc14efe8f842bb1b55d53a4e586c69fbb3b9c11995a4baa","logical_entry_identity":"31f43c304f589ca5361325ee56f90dae3024936932b9b04e982d6e37ec37aeeb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"In a selfless act, you sacrificed yourself to close the portal to the Void and thus stopped the Creator from bringing about the end of the world.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你无私地牺牲了自己，关闭通往虚空的传送门，从而阻止造物主毁灭世界。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"70a9954265c11e138ed49111d22f1ea35e4300f78aaca940023098e954608db5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e84d51ea0f3820e7849db0320959c6f0f5e7dbbfa81ef2fbc43cf82457282bd","logical_entry_identity":"3a7a272bfc57e78ace1b549737368810c50c6622744ff571054bfb1325cb9f94","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You successfully dismantled the trap.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你成功地拆除了这个陷阱。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"68744115bcabc60e48f1c37296d41baa7171aafee27f9ad4da3d508ce8546236","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e935a44a9e95aaf1e453ae09f863f9bd56dea870f982e72c55d9762dd8cf2d2","logical_entry_identity":"882fd9990fd5bcc57d751b89b3d3861deb7f75708b1ae3c3b76b4b72b72df746","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"It has a copper head and sharp venomous fangs.","source_tag":"_t","target":"它长着铜色的脑袋和锋利的毒牙。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"238cf77e4e4579d908170ce71b33b705af2722638dd9f252d371b00a68dbe5d1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e942e1dcd3e9ee7c2207c3c96cad93d696bc526eb38827c90cfa4928bd09760","logical_entry_identity":"f55f74b307ee2416a7b74642fd20e708a1d0d10eaecc55d5350fb5a77224fada","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Exp  : #00ff00#%2d%%","source_tag":"tformat","target":"经验：#00ff00#%2d%%"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c8cb66f3238527d11fded54e8cdc5bdeed26d6e791c34b381bb8767589a94d95","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e97138be509519434d2c64300efe0064340c4881b43d55c5dcb63ebb42d25a1","logical_entry_identity":"0d5fd95d1902e7e506310cf8f6f9e55894efcc93c12bc56bd70dbf2ee8a490ac","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":", mind","source_tag":"_t","target":", 精神"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b45a384ccdc433d4bce21543e81dea2a2c7a5deb181a433c2d88f6302f761c96","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e9978a46f33562cf6f493ceadfb961c403991ac494406087943dd929bfc3bfa","logical_entry_identity":"b48e351b1e65d7c54d8f46baa1259eb20a6de3d8795ec507c8fad497e5c588cf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Summon a Rimebark for %d turns to harass your foes. Rimebarks cannot move, but they have a permanent ice storm around them, damaging and freezing anything coming close in a radius of 3.\n\t\tIt will get %d Willpower, %d Cunning and %d Constitution.\n\t\tYour summons inherit some of your stats: increased damage%%, resistance penetration %%, stun/pin/confusion/blindness resistance, armour penetration.\n\t\tTheir Willpower and Cunning will increase with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"召唤 1 棵持续 %d 回合的雾凇骚扰敌人。\n\t\t雾凇不可移动，但是永远有寒冰风暴围绕着它们，伤害并冰冻 3 码半径范围内的任何人。\n\t\t它拥有 %d 点意志，%d 点灵巧和 %d 点体质。\n\t\t你的召唤物继承你部分属性：增加百分比伤害、抗性穿透、震慑/定身/混乱/致盲抵抗和护甲穿透。\n\t\t雾凇的意志和灵巧受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5131a3dee42383761f4b9ae425c1a3d4d774fb8c05f42b2a9a3c7121fb8d4b7c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e9d52a9c6ccd3d3c50b1147505260fdf0561d60afefa7686c809371bb7d0f8e","logical_entry_identity":"ca9ab19156041e2ab0d03230c73b33b89b3909f2b910bebc305e7e510702d93f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Ah, for you perhaps, but not for me.\nListen, someday you will encounter me again but it will not be me you see now. It will be younger me, if you will.\nThis is very important: do not tell my previous me about me. Understood?","source_tag":"_t","target":"啊，对你来说也许是的，不过对我来说可不是。\n听着，有一天你会再次遇到我，但你见到的不会是现在的我，而是更年轻的我。\n这一点非常重要：不要把我的事告诉过去的我。明白吗？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f90fae0d3a7a68ddb5a43297a2646b2bcf512a56799ff15d7ed3215c33d0ec1c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e9f1002c5ded717d015e9a649315a463ed0d10a161db3f432b13982dceccf56","logical_entry_identity":"b73610f49c6b0bfe7bd5b896333b76cbe68859c7897c5eb9679c41c3bf19e9b1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"titanic maul","source_tag":"_t","target":"巨型锤子"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ca7c3431b6433e10c339e20389dc0179d42771e7609fe74034c7a741625947e1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e9ff392ad938888dfb09dc4a1475f0afbe89455674dde32b1410af7b5f37758","logical_entry_identity":"d7e9d0249ec79f0fb9beb3bb14462327b660e20a5d9f11d3e86ee5df35865d4f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"bloodlich","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"血巫妖"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a706b099294ceffcd51ff4b2757df8ebed8b5d99a02589bbdb84c4a075f100d6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3ea1aaba06f461c6614620047e5a4c2e7cf9ac5f90